{%- comment -%} One FAQ row using native <details>. Accepts: question, answer (answer may contain HTML from a richtext setting). {%- endcomment -%}
<details>
  <summary><span class="q">Q</span><span>{{ question | escape }}</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
  <div class="a">{{ answer }}</div>
</details>
